Are you ready to join the humanoid company that is redefining the physical capabilities of AI?
Job Title:
Data Operations Engineer
Location:
The U.S, Remote
About this role:
We are looking for a professional Data Operations Engineer focused on leading the end-to-end delivery of high-quality embodied AI training data, bridging business requirements and technical execution to drive operational efficiency and continuous data quality optimization.
Responsibilities
Collaborate closely with business and technical teams to accurately identify data requirements, and jointly develop scientific data collection plans, annotation execution plans, and actionable delivery schedules;
Oversee end-to-end project resource management, including collection site planning, equipment allocation, material preparation, and workforce deployment, ensuring seamless coordination across all stages and stable project operations;
Track quality issues and data usage feedback throughout the production process, optimize data production solutions (e.g., collection standards, annotation guidelines) in a targeted manner, and systematically improve the accuracy, completeness, and usability of delivered data;
Develop and standardize collection and annotation protocols, systematically train partner teams to align their capabilities with project requirements, and ensure cross-team execution consistency.
Requirements
Bachelor's degree or above; all majors are welcome. Candidates with a background in Computer Science, Artificial Intelligence, or prior experience in AI-related projects are preferred;
3+ years of full-cycle delivery management experience in data collection/annotation projects; hands-on experience with data projects in robotics, autonomous driving, or related industries is highly preferred;
Extreme sensitivity to data quality with a strong sense of responsibility; capable of independently owning data quality accountability and ensuring deliverables meet high standards;
Excellent cross-functional communication and collaboration skills, with the ability to efficiently coordinate business, technical, and other resources to resolve project-related issues;
Strong product mindset, with the ability to proactively identify potential needs based on business scenarios, propose reasonable product optimization suggestions, and drive their implementation.
About Maniformer
Maniformer is an embodied AI data infrastructure platform incubated by AgiBot, dedicated to solving the industry-wide challenge of high-quality training data shortages by providing one-stop data collection hardware, simulation environments, and real-world data services.
About AGIBOT
Founded in 2023, AGIBOT is a global leader in Embodied AI and humanoid robotics. We pioneer the mass production of general-purpose intelligent machines that are actively deployed across real-world industrial and commercial sectors worldwide.
